    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI IAO Process\n\n**Purpose:**\nDispatcher for all IAO team events on a ministry request.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow called by FOI Request Routing for the `iao` event category.\n\n**Processing:**\n`Set Event Variables` reads the full event payload (`metadata.foiRequestMetaData`) into standard IDs, status and assignee fields. `IAO Event Switch` then routes by event.\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nSub-workflows run synchronously:\n- foi-iao-open-assignment, foi-iao-assignment → FOI IAO Assignment Process\n- foi-iao-open-complete, foi-iao-complete, foi-iao-reopen → FOI IAO Complete Process (which branches on the event)\n- foi-iao-correnspodence (the existing event spelling) → FOI IAO Correspondence Process\n- anything else → audit row \"no processing defined\"",
        "height": 568,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0c100ef9-2bd3-480f-9bea-ccd7944c8f73",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
